@startuml
title LLM-Powered Multilingual Translator - Sequence Diagram

autonumber

actor "Client Application\n(Chrome / PHP / Python / React Native)" as Client
participant CorsFilter as CORS
participant "CorsAwareBasicAuthenticationMechanism" as Auth
participant IdentityStoreHandler as Handler
participant EnvironmentIdentityStore as Store
participant TranslatorResource as Resource
participant TranslatorService as Service
participant GeminiClient as Gemini
participant "Google Gemini API" as API

note over Client, API
  Main translation workflow using HTTP Basic Authentication.
end note

opt Browser CORS preflight
    Client -> CORS: OPTIONS /api/translate
    CORS --> Client: 204 No Content\nCORS headers
end

Client -> CORS: POST /api/translate\nJSON + Basic Authorization
CORS -> Auth: Continue request

Auth -> Auth: Read and decode credentials
Auth -> Handler: validate(credential)
Handler -> Store: validate(credential)
Store -> Store: Compare with environment variables
Store --> Handler: CredentialValidationResult
Handler --> Auth: Authentication result

alt Valid credentials
    Auth --> Resource: Authentication successful

    Resource -> Service: translate(request)
    Service -> Service: Validate text and language
    Service -> Service: Build translation prompt

    Service -> Gemini: generateContent(prompt)
    Gemini -> API: HTTPS POST\nGemini generateContent

    alt Gemini responds successfully
        API --> Gemini: Generated translation
        Gemini -> Gemini: Parse JSON response
        Gemini --> Service: translatedText
        Service -> Service: Create TranslationResponse
        Service --> Resource: TranslationResponse
        Resource --> Client: HTTP 200 OK\nJSON response

    else Gemini service unavailable
        API --> Gemini: HTTP error
        Gemini --> Service: GeminiApiException
        Service --> Resource: Translation exception
        Resource --> Client: HTTP 502 Bad Gateway
    end

else Invalid credentials
    Auth --> Client: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
end

@enduml